/* -- System overlay menu (Menu button) ------------------------------
   The in-game system menu now stands on the SHARED console system surface
   (`.con-sys--menu` + `.con-sysact`, console_settings.less) - the same card,
   crumb head and foot bar as the settings console. The former `.con-sysmenu`
