   console's diagnostics category) lived here. */

/* ── P10: PREMIUM LOADING SCREEN (the game-boundary curtain) ───────────
   Covers the deliberate reload between the pre-game shell and the board:
   deep space → mars glow → terraforming grid → a calm orbital scanner +
   staged messages. Hosts the fullscreen-restore prompt + error/retry. */
.con-load {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 12800; /* above every game surface incl. gp chrome */
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: @con-font;
    color: @con-text;

    &__bg {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background:
            radial-gradient(ellipse at 22% 18%, rgba(30, 44, 66, 0.55), transparent 55%),
            #05070c;
    }
    &__glow {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 118%, rgba(196, 92, 48, 0.28), transparent 58%);
    }
    &__grid {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background-image:
            repeating-linear-gradient(60deg, fade(@con-cyan, 3%) 0 .05rem, transparent .05rem 3.2rem),
            repeating-linear-gradient(-60deg, fade(@con-cyan, 3%) 0 .05rem, transparent .05rem 3.2rem);
        mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 60%, black, transparent 75%);
    }
    &__vignette {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 55%, rgba(2, 4, 8, 0.8));
    }

    &__panel {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: .9rem;
        min-width: 21rem;
        padding: 1.9rem 2.7rem;
        border-radius: .8rem;
        /* PERF (Steam Deck): NO backdrop-filter — the boot curtain behind is
           already opaque, so a deeper solid glass reads identically. */
        background: rgba(8, 14, 22, 0.92);
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 .05rem fade(@con-cyan, 30%), 0 1.5rem 4.5rem rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    }
    &__scanner {
        width: 6rem;
        height: 6rem;

        svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
    }
    &__orbit {
        stroke: fade(@con-cyan, 30%);
        stroke-width: 1;
        fill: none;

        &--mid { stroke-dasharray: 4 7; }
    }
    &__planet {
        fill: rgba(196, 92, 48, 0.85);
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 .7rem rgba(196, 92, 48, 0.45));
    }
    &__sweep-group {
        transform-origin: 3rem 3rem;
